      "content": "it's not just a \"phase\" though. that's what people always say to make themselves feel better. but there's no spark left. i sit there staring at the blank page for hours and the silence is actually heavy. it's deafening. it feels like i've been emptied out on purpose. like the universe just decided i was done. how are you supposed to keep pretending there's something to find when you know for a fact there's nothing there?\n is when you realize you were just",
